  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Among statements (a) &ndash; (d), the correct ones are :<br />(a) Lime stone is decomposed to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CaO</mi></math> during the extraction of iron from its oxides.<br />(b) In the extraction of silver, silver is extracted as an anionic complex.<br />(c) Nickel is purified by Mond&rsquo;s process.<br />(d) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zr</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ti</mi></math> are purified by Van Arkel method.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ZhPto",
      "text": "(a), (b), (c) and (d)",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9nXmK",
